1982 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 1266 0 R
/T (Factory Method Pattern is used in the Food Ordering and Delivery System to dynamically create different types of notifications such as Email, SMS, and Push notifications. This pattern fits the system because the notification type depends on the communication method chosen by the user, while the system still needs a common and flexible way to create notification objects. By separating object creation from the business logic, the pattern improves scalability, flexibility, and maintainability.)
/E (Factory Method Pattern is used in the Food Ordering and Delivery System to dynamically create different types of notifications such as Email, SMS, and Push notifications. This pattern fits the system because the notification type depends on the communication method chosen by the user, while the system still needs a common and flexible way to create notification objects. By separating object creation from the business logic, the pattern improves scalability, flexibility, and maintainability.)
/Pg 211 0 R
/K [3]
>>
