/E (The Builder Pattern is used in the Food Ordering and Delivery System to construct complex Order objects step by step, assembling different parts such as OrderItems, Payment, Delivery, and Coupon based on the order type chosen by the customer. This pattern fits the system because an order's composition varies depending on whether it is a standard or scheduled order, while the system still needs a consistent and flexible way to build these objects. By separating the construction logic from the client code, the pattern improves scalability, flexibility, and maintainability.)
/Pg 213 0 R
/K [1]
>>
